<title>MALAYSIA: MOTORCYCLING-ROSSI WINS 125CC MALAYSIAN GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-ROSSI WINS 125CC MALAYSIAN GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>SHAH ALAM, Malaysia 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Valentino Rossi, riding an Aprilia, won the 125cc category in the Malaysian Motorcycle Grand Prix in a time of 48 minutes 09.93 seconds on Sunday.</p>
<p>Japanese riders Kazuto Sakata, also on an Aprilia, and Noboru Ueda, riding a Honda, finished second and third, respectively.</p>
